  "consumed": "Jellytricity Primary",
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 50eb (Costly) per dose<br><strong>Type:</strong> Street Drug</p>\n<p>Primary (4 hours): DEX +1, to a maximum of 8 (check the cap by hand). Combined with Synthcoke's Primary, BODY and WILL -2 (minimum 1), without changing HP or Death Save. You're hyperactive and impulsive. Secondary (DV17): addiction. While addicted and not on Jellytricity: DEX -2 (minimum 1), plus sluggishness and an odd craving for anything gelatinous.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p><ul><li>While addicted, switch on the \"Jellytricity Addiction\" effect.</li><li>When an addicted character doses, use \"Jellytricity Addicted Primary\" instead of the normal primary effect; it cancels the withdrawal penalties for the duration.</li><li>Stat and skill changes are automated; caps, minimums, durations, and everything else are not.</li></ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Gear, Drugs, &amp; Frames &gt; Consumables &gt; Street Drugs).</em></p>"
